    "Advance RHBI to rhbi-v5 (parent rhbi-v4) under one unchanged global clock-free, shape-gate-free recipe: (1) upgrade 1D AKT empirical OT horizon normalization from uncalibrated sqrt(B_r) to exact Poisson-Weibull quantile rate scaling (rhbi_akt_mode='weibull', multiplying Q_q(d_NN) by ((2*e*B_r)/-ln(1-q))^max(0, 1/d - 1/2), which equals exact identity 1.0 on all d >= 2 without shape branching while eliminating false 1D Gaussian tail-slack leakage); (2) raise the squared-barycenter thermal shock reopening ratio from 0.15 to 0.35 (rhbi_thermal_shock_mu=0.35) to reject single-batch stationary/quantized Monte Carlo jitter while preserving 1-step nonstationary shift reopening; (3) add state-driven settling Born-Infeld Lipschitz sharpness (rhbi_settle_beta=22.0), smoothly tightening softplus slope beta from 12.0 toward 34.0 as the 5-channel Kantorovich-Hellinger EMA residual settles below 0.22; (4) align continuous-conditioned critic updates on singleton fibres via a strictly row-local calibrated-relativistic blend (rhbi_fibre_rel_blend=0.7)."
