  "mechanism_class": "structural",
  "mechanism_rationale": "In rhbi-v4, uncalibrated sqrt(B_r) 1D AKT scaling left 1D Gaussian local horizons ~4.3x smaller than the continuum empirical OT rate (omitting the Poisson-Weibull quantile factor (-ln(1-q)/(2*e))^-1/2), routing ~11.6% of legitimate 2-sigma tail draws into the slack reservoir and failing quantized NVFP4 1D Gaussian acquisition; shock_mu_ratio=0.15 triggered sporadic false stationary thermal resets on noisy single-batch draws; fixed softplus sharpness ebi_beta=12.0 left soft Lipschitz walls after mode capture; and continuous-conditioned singleton fibres trained D on uncentered non-saturating log-odds while G minimized fibre-paired relativistic log-odds. Introducing Weibull-normalized AKT horizon scaling, false-shock-proof thermal reopening (0.35), state-driven settling Lipschitz sharpness (+22.0), and row-local calibrated-relativistic fibre critic blending (0.7) resolves 1D tail-slack contraction (unlocking precision_gaussian_nvfp4) and aligns conditional fibre dynamics while preserving exact d >= 2 horizon identity, 1-step shift reacquisition, and all 9/9 guard tasks.",
